### Visits (brief, user story 3). Every call carries X-User-Id. Run top to bottom.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@user = alice

### Mark Sweden as visited: 201 with Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/visits
X-User-Id: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"countryCode": "SWE", "note": "Midsummer in Dalarna"}

### Mark it again: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/visits
X-User-Id: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"countryCode": "SWE"}

### Unknown country: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/visits
X-User-Id: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"countryCode": "XYZ"}

### My visits, with country names and notes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/visits
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### One visit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/SWE
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### Change the note
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/SWE
X-User-Id: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note": "Fika in Uppsala"}

### Unmark: 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/SWE
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### Unmark again: 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/SWE
X-User-Id: {{user}}

### Missing X-User-Id: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/visits
